> A stale Jules/Gemini palette PR (#720) reverted the CLAUDE-SURFACE orchestrator command surface (the `/dx:` slash commands + orchestrator config.yaml + protocol). The runtime hooks from #722 are still present, but the operator-facing dx command surface is gone, degrading the dogfooding workflow. Restore the surface by cherry-picking the deleted files from `origin/task-orchestrator-claude-surface`. Scope is the `.claude` tooling surface (author/dogfood workflow), not end-user product flow — hence MED.

