## External Escalations

These are upstream in the Kotlin task-orchestrator MCP server (`dopemux-mission-control`), NOT repo packets:

- **Timestamp-parse silent-zero** — malformed/missing timestamps parse to zero instead of erroring, corrupting ordering/age computations.
- **Health-check under-report** — the health endpoint reports healthy/ready under conditions where it should report degraded, masking real failures.
- **Dangling dependency edges** — dependency edges can reference deleted/non-existent items, leaving orphaned edges in the graph.

---

